  m_text: 'To the one who finds this message,


    You are not the first to wander
    into this forsaken place, nor will you be the last. This mansion is trapped within
    a web of secrets, with mechanisms designed to prevent escape. They were put in
    place to guard against thieves and protect what lies within its walls.


    But
    hidden among the shadows is a figure known only as milady. No one remembers her
    true name, but she is the key to your escape. If you can find her, she possesses
    the power to lead you back to the world outside.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79af5aa2d9f81be4080184a80363fcfc, type: 2}
