  m_text: "Be cautious, for not everyone here can be trusted. They will observe you,
    assessing your every move without your knowledge. Yet, amidst the uncertainty,
    there is one who will genuinely offer help\u2014seek them out, for their intentions
    are pure.\n\nTime is not on your side; the mechanisms grow stronger with each
    passing moment. Trust your instincts, uncover the truth, and find milady before
    it is too late."
